If you look at the facet_wrap below, you realize that some facets have no or only one x-tick. I want to enforce at least 2 ticks per facets, even though it is logarithmically scaled. Is it possible?

The graph was produced from this code:
ggplot(data, aes(x = Frequency, y = Treatment)) +
facet_wrap(~ SG, scale = "free_x") +
