free_x certainly doesn't help you since it's clear the x-ranges among the facets are quite variable. All I could suggest would be to manually set breaks in scale_x_log10() so that you can guarantee a minimum of two tick marks per facet. Since we don't have that information available, you'll have to figure that out for yourself.

BTW, interesting graph - it looks like a poor man's density strip plot. I like it :)

Dennis

